# Docker Desktop preflight (Windows)

Before any local-vps bring-up or “VPS-like” deploy using Docker / Compose, always run:

```powershell
docker version
docker compose version
```

If either command fails (e.g. cannot connect to `dockerDesktopLinuxEngine`), treat the work as **blocked** and instruct the operator to start Docker Desktop. Resume only after `docker version` shows a Server section (Context `desktop-linux`).
